# Per-run output is regenerable; the brief and phase state (state.json)
# are not, and belong with the manuscript they describe. Unanchored (**/)
# so this matches under any manuscript directory, not just the repo root.
**/.redliner/findings/
**/.redliner/canon/

# Both binaries are downloaded by the plugins' SessionStart bootstrap
# hooks -- never source, always regenerable from the matching GitHub
# Release. bin/redliner was briefly committed on 2026-08-12 as a fallback
# for a suspected hook-reliability problem; that suspicion is now believed
# to have been a measurement artifact (see TODO.md's "Validating the
# release-repo plan"), and un-committing it takes the repo tip from 9.7MB
# back to 1.3MB.
/bin/redliner
/bin/redliner.version
/cowork/redliner
/cowork/redliner.version
